    "about.certs.lead": {en:"Independent third\u2011party certification, documented factory testing and an active patent portfolio \u2014 the evidence behind every SBKJ quote.",zh:"独立的第三方认证、完整记录的工厂测试和活跃的专利组合 \u2014 每份SBKJ报价背后的实力证明。",es:"Independent tercero\\u2011party certificación, documented fábrica testing y un active patent portfolio \\u2014 el evidence behind cada SBKJ quote.",ru:"Independent третий\\u2011party сертификация, documented завод testing и an active patent portfolio \\u2014 the evidence behind каждый SBKJ quote.",ar:"Independent ثالث\\u2011party الشهادة, documented مصنع testing و an active patent portfolio \\u2014 the evidence behind كل SBKJ quote.",tr:"Independent üçüncü\\u2011party sertifikasyon, documented fabrika testing ve bir active patent portfolio \\u2014 the evidence behind her SBKJ quote.",fr:"Independent troisième\\u2011party certification, documented usine testing et un active patent portfolio \\u2014 le evidence behind chaque SBKJ quote.",pt:"Independent terceiro\\u2011party certificação, documented fábrica testing e um active patent portfolio \\u2014 o evidence behind cada SBKJ quote.",hi:"Independent तीसरा\\u2011party प्रमाणन, documented फैक्ट्री testing और एक active patent portfolio \\u2014 the evidence behind हर SBKJ quote.",id:"Independent ketiga\\u2011party sertifikasi, documented pabrik testing dan sebuah active patent portfolio \\u2014 the evidence behind setiap SBKJ quote."},
