    "about.certs.standards.lead": {en:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order.",zh:"每条SBKJ产线均按照您订单中指定的国际制造标准进行配置，确保生产的风管符合要求。",es:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order.",ru:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order.",ar:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order.",tr:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order.",fr:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order.",pt:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order.",hi:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order.",id:"Every SBKJ line is configured to produce duct that complies with the international fabrication standard you specify on your order."},
