    "about.reach.lead": {en:"SBKJ duct machinery is working right now on six continents \u2014 in metro stations, airports, hospital cleanrooms, semiconductor fabs, data centres, commercial towers and industrial plants.",zh:"SBKJ风管机械目前正在六大洲运行 \u2014 应用于地铁站、机场、医院洁净室、半导体晶圆厂、数据中心、商业大厦和工业厂房。",es:"SBKJ maquinaria de conductos es working adecuado ahora en six continents \\u2014 en metro stations, airports, hospital cleanrooms, semiconductor fabs, data centres, commercial towers y industrial plants.",ru:"SBKJ оборудование для воздуховодов является working правильный сейчас на six continents \\u2014 в metro stations, airports, больница cleanrooms, полупроводниковый fabs, data centres, commercial towers и industrial plants.",ar:"SBKJ آلات مجاري الهواء هو working صحيح الآن على six continents \\u2014 في metro stations, airports, مستشفى cleanrooms, أشباه الموصلات fabs, data centres, commercial towers و industrial plants.",tr:"SBKJ kanal makineleri dır working doğru şimdi üzerinde six continents \\u2014 de metro stations, airports, hastane cleanrooms, yarı iletken fabs, data centres, commercial towers ve industrial plants.",fr:"SBKJ machines de conduits est working bon maintenant sur six continents \\u2014 dans metro stations, airports, hôpital cleanrooms, semi-conducteur fabs, data centres, commercial towers et industrial plants.",pt:"SBKJ maquinário de dutos é working certo agora em six continents \\u2014 em metro stations, airports, hospital cleanrooms, semicondutor fabs, data centres, commercial towers e industrial plants.",hi:"SBKJ डक्ट मशीनरी है working सही अब पर six continents \\u2014 में metro stations, airports, अस्पताल cleanrooms, सेमीकंडक्टर fabs, data centres, commercial towers और industrial plants.",id:"SBKJ mesin saluran adalah working tepat sekarang pada six continents \\u2014 di metro stations, airports, rumah sakit cleanrooms, semikonduktor fabs, data centres, commercial towers dan industrial plants."},
    "about.reach.mena.title": {en:"Middle East & North Africa",zh:"中东与北非",es:"Oriente Medio y Norte de África",ru:"Ближний Восток и Северная Африка",ar:"الشرق الأوسط وشمال أفريقيا",tr:"Orta Doğu ve Kuzey Afrika",fr:"Moyen-Orient et Afrique du Nord",pt:"Oriente Médio e Norte da África",hi:"मध्य पूर्व और उत्तरी अफ्रीका",id:"Timur Tengah dan Afrika Utara"},
    "about.reach.mena.note": {en:"Flagship: multi\u2011line SBAL and SBTF installations for Gulf airport expansions.",zh:"旗舰项目：为海湾地区机场扩建提供多线SBAL和SBTF安装。",es:"Flagship: multi\\u2011línea SBAL y SBTF installations para Gulf airport expansions.",ru:"Flagship: multi\\u2011линия SBAL и SBTF installations для Gulf airport expansions.",ar:"Flagship: multi\\u2011خط SBAL و SBTF installations لـ Gulf airport expansions.",tr:"Flagship: multi\\u2011hat SBAL ve SBTF installations için Gulf airport expansions.",fr:"Flagship: multi\\u2011ligne SBAL et SBTF installations pour Gulf airport expansions.",pt:"Flagship: multi\\u2011linha SBAL e SBTF installations para Gulf airport expansions.",hi:"Flagship: multi\\u2011लाइन SBAL और SBTF installations के लिए Gulf airport expansions.",id:"Flagship: multi\\u2011jalur SBAL dan SBTF installations untuk Gulf airport expansions."},
