    "why.cta.quote": {en:"Request a quotation in 12 hours &rarr;",zh:"12小时内获取报价 &rarr;",es:"Request un cotización en 12 horas &rarr;",ru:"Request a коммерческое предложение в 12 часов &rarr;",ar:"Request a عرض أسعار في 12 ساعات &rarr;",tr:"Request bir teklif de 12 saat &rarr;",fr:"Request un devis dans 12 heures &rarr;",pt:"Request um cotação em 12 horas &rarr;",hi:"Request एक कोटेशन में 12 घंटे &rarr;",id:"Request sebuah penawaran di 12 jam &rarr;"},
    "why.promise.label": {en:"12-hour reply",zh:"12小时回复",es:"Respuesta en 12 horas",ru:"Ответ за 12 часов",ar:"رد خلال 12 ساعة",tr:"12 saat içinde yanıt",fr:"Réponse en 12 heures",pt:"Resposta em 12 horas",hi:"12 घंटे में उत्तर",id:"Balasan dalam 12 jam"},
    "why.promise.text": {en:"Every SBKJ enquiry is routed to a mechanical engineer in the Box Hill North office and answered within 12 hours with a configuration, a workshop layout sketch and an itemised budget.",zh:"每条SBKJ询盘都转给Box Hill North办公室的机械工程师，并在12小时内回复设备配置、车间布局草图和逐项预算。",es:"Cada SBKJ enquiry es routed un un mechanical ingeniero en el Box Hill North office y answered within 12 horas con un configuración, un taller layout sketch y un itemised budget.",ru:"Каждый SBKJ enquiry является routed к a mechanical инженер в the Бокс Хилл Норт office и answered within 12 часов с a конфигурация, a мастерская layout sketch и an itemised budget.",ar:"كل SBKJ enquiry هو routed إلى a mechanical مهندس في the بوكس هيل نورث office و answered within 12 ساعات مع a التكوين, a ورشة layout sketch و an itemised budget.",tr:"Her SBKJ enquiry dır routed to bir mechanical mühendis de the Box Hill North office ve answered within 12 saat ile bir yapılandırma, bir atölye layout sketch ve bir itemised budget.",fr:"Chaque SBKJ enquiry est routed à un mechanical ingénieur dans le Box Hill North office et answered within 12 heures avec un configuration, un atelier layout sketch et un itemised budget.",pt:"Cada SBKJ enquiry é routed para um mechanical engenheiro em o Box Hill North office e answered within 12 horas com um configuração, um oficina layout sketch e um itemised budget.",hi:"हर SBKJ enquiry है routed को एक mechanical इंजीनियर में the बॉक्स हिल नॉर्थ office और answered within 12 घंटे के साथ एक कॉन्फ़िगरेशन, एक वर्कशॉप layout sketch और एक itemised budget.",id:"Setiap SBKJ enquiry adalah routed ke sebuah mechanical insinyur di the Box Hill North office dan answered within 12 jam dengan sebuah konfigurasi, sebuah bengkel layout sketch dan sebuah itemised budget."},

