    "insights.lead": {en:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia.",zh:"由澳大利亚墨尔本SBKJ工程团队撰写，面向采购商、加工厂和工厂规划师的实用工程师指南。",es:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia.",ru:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia.",ar:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia.",tr:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia.",fr:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia.",pt:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia.",hi:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia.",id:"Practical, engineer-led guides on HVAC ductwork machinery — written for buyers, fabricators and factory planners by the SBKJ Engineering team in Box Hill North, Australia."},
