    "cases.saudi.title": {en:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">Saudi Arabia &mdash; SBTF-1602 spiral tubeformer brings duct production in-house</a>",zh:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">沙特阿拉伯&mdash;SBTF-1602螺旋风管机实现风管自主生产</a>",es:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">Arabia Saudita &mdash; SBTF-1602 formadora de tubos espirales brings producción de conductos in-house</a>",ru:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">Саудовская Аравия &mdash; SBTF-1602 спиральный трубоформер brings производство воздуховодов in-house</a>",ar:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">المملكة العربية السعودية &mdash; SBTF-1602 آلة تشكيل الأنابيب الحلزونية brings إنتاج مجاري الهواء in-house</a>",tr:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">Suudi Arabistan &mdash; SBTF-1602 spiral boru şekillendirici brings kanal üretimi in-house</a>",fr:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">Arabie saoudite &mdash; SBTF-1602 tubeformer spiralé brings production de conduits in-house</a>",pt:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">Arábia Saudita &mdash; SBTF-1602 formadora de tubos espirais brings produção de dutos in-house</a>",hi:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">सऊदी अरब &mdash; SBTF-1602 स्पाइरल ट्यूबफॉर्मर brings डक्ट उत्पादन in-house</a>",id:"<a href=\"saudi-sbtf-1602-spiral-duct.html\">Arab Saudi &mdash; SBTF-1602 tubeformer spiral brings produksi saluran in-house</a>"},
    "cases.vietnam.desc": {en:"A mid-size HVAC duct fabrication business in Ho Chi Minh City replaced a 10-operator manual workshop with a single SBAL-V auto duct line. Daily output tripled, rework rate dropped from 5.5% to 0.8%, and the workforce reallocated from hand-forming to install-team deployment. The case study covers the full SBAL-V configuration, the 58-day lead time, the 5-day on-site commissioning and the first-year results.",zh:"胡志明市一家中型暖通风管制造企业用一条SBAL-V自动风管生产线替代了10人手工车间。日产量提升三倍，返工率从5.5%降至0.8%，人力从手工成型重新分配至安装团队。案例研究涵盖完整的SBAL-V配置、58天交期、5天现场调试和第一年成果。",es:"Un mid-size conducto HVAC fabrication business en Ho Chi Minh City replaced un 10-operator manual taller con un single SBAL-V línea automática de conductos. Daily output tripled, rework tasa dropped de 5.5% un 0.8%, y el workforce reallocated de hand-forming un install-team deployment. El caso de estudio cubre el completo SBAL-V configuración, el 58-day plazo de entrega, el 5-day puesta en marcha en situ y el first-year resultados.",ru:"A mid-size HVAC duct fabrication business in Ho Chi Minh City replaced a 10-operator manual workshop with a single SBAL-V auto duct line. Daily output tripled, rework rate dropped from 5.5% to 0.8%, and the workforce reallocated from hand-forming to install-team deployment. The case study covers the full SBAL-V configuration, the 58-day lead time, the 5-day on-site commissioning and the first-year results.",ar:"A mid-size HVAC duct fabrication business in Ho Chi Minh City replaced a 10-operator manual workshop with a single SBAL-V auto duct line. Daily output tripled, rework rate dropped from 5.5% to 0.8%, and the workforce reallocated from hand-forming to install-team deployment. The case study covers the full SBAL-V configuration, the 58-day lead time, the 5-day on-site commissioning and the first-year results.",tr:"A mid-size HVAC duct fabrication business in Ho Chi Minh City replaced a 10-operator manual workshop with a single SBAL-V auto duct line. Daily output tripled, rework rate dropped from 5.5% to 0.8%, and the workforce reallocated from hand-forming to install-team deployment. The case study covers the full SBAL-V configuration, the 58-day lead time, the 5-day on-site commissioning and the first-year results.",fr:"Un mid-size conduit HVAC fabrication business dans Ho Chi Minh City replaced un 10-operator manual atelier avec un single SBAL-V ligne automatique de conduits. Daily output tripled, rework taux dropped de 5.5% à 0.8%, et le workforce reallocated de hand-forming à install-team deployment. Le étude de cas couvre le complet SBAL-V configuration, le 58-day délai de livraison, le 5-day mise en service sur site et le first-year résultats.",pt:"Um mid-size duto HVAC fabrication business em Ho Chi Minh City replaced um 10-operator manual oficina com um single SBAL-V linha automática de dutos. Daily output tripled, rework taxa dropped de 5.5% para 0.8%, e o workforce reallocated de hand-forming para install-team deployment. O estudo de caso cobre o completo SBAL-V configuração, o 58-day prazo de entrega, o 5-day comissionamento no local e o first-year resultados.",hi:"A mid-size HVAC duct fabrication business in Ho Chi Minh City replaced a 10-operator manual workshop with a single SBAL-V auto duct line. Daily output tripled, rework rate dropped from 5.5% to 0.8%, and the workforce reallocated from hand-forming to install-team deployment. The case study covers the full SBAL-V configuration, the 58-day lead time, the 5-day on-site commissioning and the first-year results.",id:"A mid-size HVAC duct fabrication business in Ho Chi Minh City replaced a 10-operator manual workshop with a single SBAL-V auto duct line. Daily output tripled, rework rate dropped from 5.5% to 0.8%, and the workforce reallocated from hand-forming to install-team deployment. The case study covers the full SBAL-V configuration, the 58-day lead time, the 5-day on-site commissioning and the first-year results."},
    "cases.vietnam.meta": {en:"<strong>Country:</strong> Vietnam (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>Machine:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>Year:</strong> 2023",zh:"<strong>国家：</strong>越南（胡志明市）&middot; <strong>设备：</strong>SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>年份：</strong>2023",es:"<strong>País:</strong> Vietnam (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>Máquina:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>Año:</strong> 2023",ru:"<strong>Страна:</strong> Вьетнам (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>Машина:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>Год:</strong> 2023",ar:"<strong>دولة:</strong> فيتنام (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>آلة:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>سنة:</strong> 2023",tr:"<strong>Ülke:</strong> Vietnam (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>Makine:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>Yıl:</strong> 2023",fr:"<strong>Pays:</strong> Vietnam (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>Machine:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>Un:</strong> 2023",pt:"<strong>País:</strong> Vietnã (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>Máquina:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>Ano:</strong> 2023",hi:"<strong>देश:</strong> वियतनाम (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>मशीन:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>वर्ष:</strong> 2023",id:"<strong>Negara:</strong> Vietnam (Ho Chi Minh City) &middot; <strong>Mesin:</strong> SBAL-V-1250U &middot; <strong>Tahun:</strong> 2023"},
