    "pricing.budget.li6": {en:"<strong>Freight, customs, installation (at destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",zh:"<strong>运费、清关、安装（目的地）：</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",es:"<strong>Freight, customs, instalación (en destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",ru:"<strong>Freight, customs, установка (в destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",ar:"<strong>Freight, customs, التركيب (في destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",tr:"<strong>Freight, customs, kurulum (de destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",fr:"<strong>Freight, customs, installation (à destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",pt:"<strong>Freight, customs, instalação (em destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",hi:"<strong>Freight, customs, इंस्टॉलेशन (पर destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000",id:"<strong>Freight, customs, instalasi (di destination):</strong> USD 25,000 &ndash; USD 60,000"},
    "pricing.budget.li7": {en:"<strong>Workshop infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically by country)",zh:"<strong>车间基础设施（地坪、电气、起重机）：</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000（因国家不同差异很大）",es:"<strong>Taller infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically por país)",ru:"<strong>Мастерская infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically by страна)",ar:"<strong>ورشة infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically بواسطة دولة)",tr:"<strong>Atölye infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically tarafından ülke)",fr:"<strong>Atelier infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically par pays)",pt:"<strong>Oficina infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically por país)",hi:"<strong>वर्कशॉप infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically द्वारा देश)",id:"<strong>Bengkel infrastructure (slab, electrical, cranes):</strong> USD 40,000 &ndash; USD 120,000 (varies dramatically oleh negara)"},
    "pricing.budget.li8": {en:"<strong>Total landed workshop budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",zh:"<strong>车间总到岸预算：</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",es:"<strong>Total landed taller budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",ru:"<strong>Total landed мастерская budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",ar:"<strong>Total landed ورشة budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",tr:"<strong>Total landed atölye budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",fr:"<strong>Total landed atelier budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",pt:"<strong>Total landed oficina budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",hi:"<strong>Total landed वर्कशॉप budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000",id:"<strong>Total landed bengkel budget:</strong> USD 377,000 &ndash; USD 745,000"},
    "pricing.budget.notes": {en:"The full layout planning for this class of workshop is covered in the <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">HVAC duct factory layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ also prepares free workshop layout sketches as part of every multi-machine quotation, showing where each machine sits relative to the coil store, the cutting bay, the assembly area and the loading dock.",zh:"此类车间的完整布局规划详见<a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">暖通风管工厂布局规划指南</a>。SBKJ还会在每份多设备报价中免费提供车间布局草图，展示每台设备相对于卷材仓库、切割区、组装区和装货区的位置。",es:"El completo layout planning para este class de taller es covered en el <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">conducto HVAC fábrica layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ también prepares free taller layout sketches as part de cada multi-machine cotización, showing donde cada máquina sits relative un el coil store, el cutting bay, el assembly area y el loading dock.",ru:"The full layout planning for this class of workshop is covered in the <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">HVAC duct factory layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ also prepares free workshop layout sketches as part of every multi-machine quotation, showing where each machine sits relative to the coil store, the cutting bay, the assembly area and the loading dock.",ar:"The full layout planning for this class of workshop is covered in the <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">HVAC duct factory layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ also prepares free workshop layout sketches as part of every multi-machine quotation, showing where each machine sits relative to the coil store, the cutting bay, the assembly area and the loading dock.",tr:"The full layout planning for this class of workshop is covered in the <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">HVAC duct factory layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ also prepares free workshop layout sketches as part of every multi-machine quotation, showing where each machine sits relative to the coil store, the cutting bay, the assembly area and the loading dock.",fr:"Le complet layout planning pour ce class de atelier est covered dans le <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">conduit HVAC usine layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ aussi prepares free atelier layout sketches as part de chaque multi-machine devis, showing où chaque machine sits relative à le coil store, le cutting bay, le assembly area et le loading dock.",pt:"O completo layout planning para este class de oficina é covered em o <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">duto HVAC fábrica layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ também prepares free oficina layout sketches as part de cada multi-machine cotação, showing onde cada máquina sits relative para o coil store, o cutting bay, o assembly area e o loading dock.",hi:"The full layout planning for this class of workshop is covered in the <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">HVAC duct factory layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ also prepares free workshop layout sketches as part of every multi-machine quotation, showing where each machine sits relative to the coil store, the cutting bay, the assembly area and the loading dock.",id:"The full layout planning for this class of workshop is covered in the <a href=\"insights/hvac-duct-factory-layout.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.ins.layout\">HVAC duct factory layout planning guide</a>. SBKJ also prepares free workshop layout sketches as part of every multi-machine quotation, showing where each machine sits relative to the coil store, the cutting bay, the assembly area and the loading dock."},
